IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `coa-core`
IMPORT `coa29-sch4`

-- coa29-tests-sch4.l4: tests for coa29-sch4.l4 (Schedule 4: documents and information sent or supplied to a company).
-- Generated by work/gen_tests_sch4.py. Every expected value is written by hand from the text of the Schedule, beside the case; none is
-- copied from the encoding's output. Quote lines live in the module, not here.


§§ `Part 1 -- para 1: application of the Schedule`

-- Para 1(1): the Schedule applies to documents or information sent or supplied to a company.
-- sent to a company, not by another company: applies
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 1 this Schedule applies to the document or information` WITH `the document or information is sent or supplied to a company` IS TRUE, `the document or information is sent or supplied by another company` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Para 1(2): it does not apply to documents or information sent or supplied by another company.
-- sent to a company by another company: does not apply (a flat negative)
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 1 this Schedule applies to the document or information` WITH `the document or information is sent or supplied to a company` IS TRUE, `the document or information is sent or supplied by another company` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sent by another company (the other input is not stated): does not apply
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 1 this Schedule applies to the document or information` WITH `the document or information is sent or supplied to a company` IS FALSE, `the document or information is sent or supplied by another company` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Neither limb: the text is silent about a document not sent to a company (scope limit with no 'only').
-- not sent to a company and not by another company: not covered
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 1 this Schedule applies to the document or information` WITH `the document or information is sent or supplied to a company` IS FALSE, `the document or information is sent or supplied by another company` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Part 2 -- paras 2 to 4: hard copy form`

-- Para 3(2): a person sends by post if he posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information.
-- posts a prepaid envelope
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 3(2) the person sends the document or information by post` WITH `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no prepaid envelope posted (an unmet 'if': marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 3(2) the person sends the document or information by post` WITH `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Para 3(1): hard copy may be sent or supplied by hand or by post.
-- by hand
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 3(1) the means is one by which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by hand`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- by post, a prepaid envelope posted
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 3(1) the means is one by which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by post`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- by post without a prepaid envelope: outside the grant, which is 'by hand or by post' and by post means a prepaid envelope
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 3(1) the means is one by which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by post`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- by electronic means: not one of the two means the grant names
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 3(1) the means is one by which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by electronic means`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- by some other means: not one of the two means the grant names
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 3(1) the means is one by which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by some other means`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 4: hard copy may be sent (a) to an address specified by the company for the purpose, (b) to the registered office, (c) to an address to which a provision of the Companies Acts authorises it to be sent.
-- limb (a) only
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4 the address is one to which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS TRUE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- limb (b) only
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4 the address is one to which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- limb (c) only
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4 the address is one to which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- all three
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4 the address is one to which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS TRUE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- none of the three: the list is not closed with 'only'
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4 the address is one to which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 4 and the s 86 seam: s 86 is a MAYBE BOOLEAN input, so JUST FALSE from s 86 and NOTHING from s 86 both leave limb (b) unmet; with no other limb the answer is NOTHING either way, and with another limb it is JUST TRUE.
-- s 86 says JUST FALSE (not the registered office) and no other limb holds
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4 the address is one to which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST FALSE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 86 says NOTHING (not known) but the address is specified by the company for the purpose
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4 the address is one to which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS TRUE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 86 says NOTHING (not known) and no other limb holds
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4 the address is one to which hard copy may be sent or supplied` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- Para 2: validly sent in hard copy form if sent in hard copy form in accordance with this Part (paras 3 and 4).
-- hard copy, by hand, to the registered office
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 2 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in hard copy form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 hard copy form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by hand`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- hard copy, by post in a prepaid envelope, to an address the company specified
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 2 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in hard copy form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 hard copy form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by post`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS TRUE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS TRUE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- hard copy, by hand, to an address a provision of the Companies Acts authorises
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 2 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in hard copy form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 hard copy form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by hand`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- hard copy, by post with no prepaid envelope, to the registered office: not in accordance with para 3 (marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 2 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in hard copy form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 hard copy form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by post`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- hard copy, by hand, to an address that is none of (a) to (c): not in accordance with para 4 (marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 2 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in hard copy form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 hard copy form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by hand`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- hard copy, by electronic means, to the registered office: not in accordance with para 3 (marginal reading (a))
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 2 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in hard copy form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 hard copy form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by electronic means`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- electronic form: para 2 is about hard copy form
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 2 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in hard copy form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 electronic form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by hand`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- neither hard copy nor electronic form: para 2 is about hard copy form
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 2 the document or information is validly sent or supplied in hard copy form` WITH `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 neither hard copy form nor electronic form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by hand`, `the person posts a prepaid envelope containing the document or information` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Part 2A -- para 4A: electronic form from the registrar or the Secretary of State`

-- Para 4A(2): by electronic means it may only be sent (a) for a company registered under this Act, to its registered email address; (b) for any company, to an address it specified for that purpose.
-- limb (a): a company registered under this Act, its registered email address
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(2) the address is one to which the registrar or the Secretary of State may send it by electronic means` WITH `the company is registered under this Act` IS TRUE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS TRUE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- limb (b): any company, an address it specified for that purpose
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(2) the address is one to which the registrar or the Secretary of State may send it by electronic means` WITH `the company is registered under this Act` IS FALSE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- both limbs
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(2) the address is one to which the registrar or the Secretary of State may send it by electronic means` WITH `the company is registered under this Act` IS TRUE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS TRUE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- registered email address of a company not registered under this Act: limb (a) is for a company registered under this Act
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(2) the address is one to which the registrar or the Secretary of State may send it by electronic means` WITH `the company is registered under this Act` IS FALSE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS TRUE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a company registered under this Act, but an address that is not its registered email address and not specified
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(2) the address is one to which the registrar or the Secretary of State may send it by electronic means` WITH `the company is registered under this Act` IS TRUE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- neither limb: 'it may only be sent'
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(2) the address is one to which the registrar or the Secretary of State may send it by electronic means` WITH `the company is registered under this Act` IS FALSE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Para 4A(3): by hand or by post, in electronic form, it must go to an address to which it could be validly sent in hard copy form (para 4).
-- an address the company specified for the purpose
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(3) the address is one to which the registrar or the Secretary of State may send or supply it in electronic form by hand or by post` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS TRUE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the registered office
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(3) the address is one to which the registrar or the Secretary of State may send or supply it in electronic form by hand or by post` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an address a provision of the Companies Acts authorises
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(3) the address is one to which the registrar or the Secretary of State may send or supply it in electronic form by hand or by post` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an address that could not be validly used for hard copy: a bare 'must' not done (fork)
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(3) the address is one to which the registrar or the Secretary of State may send or supply it in electronic form by hand or by post` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Para 4A(1): validly sent by the registrar or the Secretary of State if in electronic form in accordance with (2) or (3).
-- by electronic means to a registered company's registered email address
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(1) the document or information is validly sent or supplied by the registrar or the Secretary of State in electronic form` WITH `the sender is the registrar or the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 electronic form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by electronic means`, `the company is registered under this Act` IS TRUE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS TRUE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- by electronic means to an address specified for that purpose
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(1) the document or information is validly sent or supplied by the registrar or the Secretary of State in electronic form` WITH `the sender is the registrar or the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 electronic form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by electronic means`, `the company is registered under this Act` IS FALSE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS TRUE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- by electronic means to an address that is neither
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(1) the document or information is validly sent or supplied by the registrar or the Secretary of State in electronic form` WITH `the sender is the registrar or the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 electronic form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by electronic means`, `the company is registered under this Act` IS FALSE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a disk by post to the registered office (sub-paragraph (3))
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(1) the document or information is validly sent or supplied by the registrar or the Secretary of State in electronic form` WITH `the sender is the registrar or the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 electronic form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by post`, `the company is registered under this Act` IS FALSE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a disk by hand to an address the company specified for the purpose (sub-paragraph (3))
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(1) the document or information is validly sent or supplied by the registrar or the Secretary of State in electronic form` WITH `the sender is the registrar or the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 electronic form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by hand`, `the company is registered under this Act` IS FALSE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS TRUE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a disk by post to an address that is not a hard copy address (sub-paragraph (3))
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(1) the document or information is validly sent or supplied by the registrar or the Secretary of State in electronic form` WITH `the sender is the registrar or the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 electronic form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by post`, `the company is registered under this Act` IS FALSE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- electronic form sent by some other means: neither sub-paragraph (2) nor (3)
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(1) the document or information is validly sent or supplied by the registrar or the Secretary of State in electronic form` WITH `the sender is the registrar or the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 electronic form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by some other means`, `the company is registered under this Act` IS FALSE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the sender is not the registrar or the Secretary of State: Part 2A is limited to them
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(1) the document or information is validly sent or supplied by the registrar or the Secretary of State in electronic form` WITH `the sender is the registrar or the Secretary of State` IS FALSE, `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 electronic form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by electronic means`, `the company is registered under this Act` IS TRUE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS TRUE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- hard copy form: Part 2A is about electronic form
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(1) the document or information is validly sent or supplied by the registrar or the Secretary of State in electronic form` WITH `the sender is the registrar or the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 hard copy form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by hand`, `the company is registered under this Act` IS FALSE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- neither hard copy nor electronic form: Part 2A is about electronic form
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 4A(1) the document or information is validly sent or supplied by the registrar or the Secretary of State in electronic form` WITH `the sender is the registrar or the Secretary of State` IS TRUE, `the form of the document or information` IS `sch 4 neither hard copy form nor electronic form`, `the means of sending or supplying` IS `sch 4 by hand`, `the company is registered under this Act` IS FALSE, `the address is the company's registered email address` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for that purpose (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE, `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Part 3 -- paras 5 to 7: electronic form in other cases`

-- Para 6: may only be sent in electronic form if (a) the company has agreed (and has not revoked) or (b) is deemed by a provision in the Companies Acts to have agreed.
-- limb (a): agreed, not revoked
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied to the company in electronic form` WITH `the company has agreed (generally or specifically) that the document or information may be sent or supplied in electronic form` IS TRUE, `the company has revoked that agreement` IS FALSE, `the company is deemed to have agreed by a provision in the Companies Acts` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- limb (a) fails: agreed but revoked, and not deemed
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied to the company in electronic form` WITH `the company has agreed (generally or specifically) that the document or information may be sent or supplied in electronic form` IS TRUE, `the company has revoked that agreement` IS TRUE, `the company is deemed to have agreed by a provision in the Companies Acts` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- limb (b): deemed to have agreed
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied to the company in electronic form` WITH `the company has agreed (generally or specifically) that the document or information may be sent or supplied in electronic form` IS FALSE, `the company has revoked that agreement` IS FALSE, `the company is deemed to have agreed by a provision in the Companies Acts` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- agreement revoked but limb (b) holds
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied to the company in electronic form` WITH `the company has agreed (generally or specifically) that the document or information may be sent or supplied in electronic form` IS TRUE, `the company has revoked that agreement` IS TRUE, `the company is deemed to have agreed by a provision in the Companies Acts` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- neither limb: 'may only be sent ... if'
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 6 the document or information may be sent or supplied to the company in electronic form` WITH `the company has agreed (generally or specifically) that the document or information may be sent or supplied in electronic form` IS FALSE, `the company has revoked that agreement` IS FALSE, `the company is deemed to have agreed by a provision in the Companies Acts` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Para 7(1): by electronic means it may only go to an address (a) specified for the purpose by the company or (b) deemed by a provision in the Companies Acts to have been so specified.
-- limb (a)
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 7(1) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied by electronic means` WITH `the address is specified for the purpose by the company (generally or specifically)` IS TRUE, `the address is deemed by a provision in the Companies Acts to have been so specified` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- limb (b)
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 7(1) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied by electronic means` WITH `the address is specified for the purpose by the company (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE, `the address is deemed by a provision in the Companies Acts to have been so specified` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- neither: 'may only be sent or supplied to an address'
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 7(1) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied by electronic means` WITH `the address is specified for the purpose by the company (generally or specifically)` IS FALSE, `the address is deemed by a provision in the Companies Acts to have been so specified` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Para 7(2): by hand or by post in electronic form it must go to an address to which it could be validly sent in hard copy form.
-- the registered office
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 7(2) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied in electronic form by hand or by post` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS JUST TRUE, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an address the company specified for the purpose
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 7(2) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied in electronic form by hand or by post` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS TRUE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an address that is none of the hard copy addresses: a bare 'must' not done (fork)
#ASSERT (`sch 4 para 7(2) the address is one to which it may be sent or supplied in electronic form by hand or by post` WITH `the address is specified by the company for the purpose` IS FALSE, `s 86 the company has its registered office at the address` IS NOTHING, `a provision of the Companies Acts authorises the document or information to be sent or supplied to the address` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Para 5: validly sent by a person other than the registrar or the Secretary of State if in electronic form in accordance with Part 3.
-- by electronic means: agreed and sent to an address the company specified
